flowchart LR
  subgraph U[Untrusted zone: user device]
    G[Guest]
    P[Parent or guardian]
    S[Assigned specialist]
    B[React browser client]
  end
  subgraph T[Transport boundary: HTTPS]
    API[Go HTTP API]
  end
  subgraph Z[Trusted application and data zone]
    AUTH[Authentication and session service]
    AUTHZ[RBAC and child relationship checks]
    APP[Profile, session and diary services]
    DB[(PostgreSQL: profiles, assignments, diary)]
    AUD[(Append-only audit events)]
  end
  G -->|public pages, register/login| B
  P -->|authenticated actions| B
  S -->|authenticated actions| B
  B -->|untrusted input + access credential| API
  API --> AUTH
  AUTH --> AUTHZ
  AUTHZ -->|allow only role + active relationship + visibility| APP
  AUTHZ -->|deny decision| AUD
  APP -->|minimum necessary query| DB
  APP -->|read/write/export event| AUD
  DB -->|authorized response| APP
  APP --> API --> B
